    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/3e1728cb2555b4199ef2115cc52adc27.webp?t=1753887990\" width=654 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The B.L.O.O.M (Biotech Lethal Offensive Organic Munitions) Initiative</i> is a fast-paced <strong>2D top-down shoot 'em up</strong> where you pilot a drone through procedurally generated battlefields. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/ddaed2eb127d3329fd1931d88abc4a5a.poster.avif?t=1753887990\" width=38 height=38 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/ddaed2eb127d3329fd1931d88abc4a5a.webm?t=1753887990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/793c0967a60c59a6eca757b60b1fb91f.poster.avif?t=1753887990\" width=43 height=43 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/793c0967a60c59a6eca757b60b1fb91f.webm?t=1753887990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/ddaed2eb127d3329fd1931d88abc4a5a.poster.avif?t=1753887990\" width=38 height=38 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/ddaed2eb127d3329fd1931d88abc4a5a.webm?t=1753887990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/793c0967a60c59a6eca757b60b1fb91f.poster.avif?t=1753887990\" width=43 height=43 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/793c0967a60c59a6eca757b60b1fb91f.webm?t=1753887990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/ddaed2eb127d3329fd1931d88abc4a5a.poster.avif?t=1753887990\" width=38 height=38 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/ddaed2eb127d3329fd1931d88abc4a5a.webm?t=1753887990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Harvest, Build &amp; Defend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: <strong>gather resources, plant lethal bio-organisms, and defend your bases</strong> from relentless alien and native species on the hostile planet <strong>Shlee</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/67dbb8a85b4dd94346aa1760fc4abe9c.poster.avif?t=1753887990\" width=480 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/67dbb8a85b4dd94346aa1760fc4abe9c.webm?t=1753887990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/67dbb8a85b4dd94346aa1760fc4abe9c.mp4?t=1753887990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Training to Total War</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in a basic training drone as you <strong>learn to build, plant, and fight</strong>, then dive into intense battles as two aggressive alien factions take an interest in your expanding operations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/f34750fae5268449213d509823feeeb4.poster.avif?t=1753887990\" width=480 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/f34750fae5268449213d509823feeeb4.webm?t=1753887990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/f34750fae5268449213d509823feeeb4.mp4?t=1753887990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade, Adapt, and Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your drone, adapt your strategies, and <strong>survive against overwhelming odds in this fusion of action and strategy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/1bf5ea9c424444e133be01ed359b1446.poster.avif?t=1753887990\" width=480 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/1bf5ea9c424444e133be01ed359b1446.webm?t=1753887990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/1bf5ea9c424444e133be01ed359b1446.mp4?t=1753887990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
